{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011870/extras/ed24d54b1e7e6590f45bea7f6fd5b615.avif?t=1758912952\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br>Shadow\u2019s Grove is an emotionally-driven action adventure game following the journey of Astrid, a young spirit guide struggling to accept the loss of her lifelong companion, Eri. As she navigates the Valley of Souls, Eri\u2019s fading presence becomes invaluable to her as the two rely on one another to uncover new paths and confront powerful spirits. But, the longer Astrid remains in the afterlife, the clearer the truth becomes to her and Eri: that moving forward may mean letting go.<br><br>In this journey, you\u2019ll guide Astrid through a world brimming with heart and mystery, uncovering the true nature of the afterlife while forging an unbreakable bond with Eri.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011870/extras/a40fc13b180859695c853dd6bb194d1f.avif?t=1758912952\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Traverse a range of hand-crafted, otherworldly environments</strong> while carefully shifting between human and wolf form<br></li><li><strong>Solve environmental puzzles</strong> to forge a path through the malleable fabric of the afterlife<br></li><li><strong>Vanquish corrupted spirits</strong> using the collaborative power of Astrid\u2019s magic and Eri\u2019s strength<br></li><li>I<strong>mmerse yourself in the rich, emotional soundtrack</strong> that deepens the narrative of loss, connection, and discovery</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011870/extras/a0314dc9cb71f37107ea1d9189626940.avif?t=1758912952\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br>This game was developed as a student project at Di